php-tokenizer \
unzip \
git \
curl

4. Install Composer
cd /tmp
curl -sS https://getcomposer.org/installer -o composer-setup.php
php composer-setup.php --install-dir=/usr/local/bin --filename=composer

5. Install MariaDB
sudo apt install -y mariadb-server mariadb-client

Start:
sudo service mariadb start


Masuk MariaDB:
sudo mariadb

6. Buat database Laravel

CREATE DATABASE backend;

gawe user:
CREATE USER 'backend_user'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'backend123';

 akses:
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON backend.* TO 'backend_user'@'localhost';

Simpan:
FLUSH PRIVILEGES;

Keluar:
EXIT;

7. gawe project Laravel
cd /var/www
sudo composer create-project laravel/laravel backend

Masuk:
cd /var/www/backend

Atur permission:
sudo chown -R $USER:$USER /var/www/backend

8. Buat .env
cp .env.example .env

Generate application key:
php artisan key:generate

9. Atur database
Buka:
nano .env

Cari bagian database dan ubah menjadi:
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=backend
DB_USERNAME=backend_user
DB_PASSWORD=backend123

Simpan
10. Test koneksi database
php artisan migrate

11. Jalankan Laravel
php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0

kudune metu:
INFO  Server running on [http://0.0.0.0:8000].

teko windows Windows buka:
http://localhost:8000

Cek:
php -v
composer --version

Start MariaDB:
sudo service mariadb start

Cek Laravel:
php artisan --version

Cek database:
php artisan migrate:status

Lalu jalankan:
php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0
